  "body": "Add a closed four-case CPU fixture profile for the pinned existing image loader. It observes same-library and cross-SONAME explicit nondefault version binding, with separate missing declared-version and wrong target-version controls. The source-bound CLI requires explicit CPU opt-in, exact source/CI/provenance, fixed output and loader hash; it cannot select an SDK payload. Historical SDK/scientific authority, old318sources and all prior verdicts remain unchanged.\n\nFixtures are handwritten nostdlib constant-return C/assembly with a validated call/exit entry, closed private dependencies, no constructors/RPATH/IFUNC, sanitized environment and bounded owned processes. Counts persist before spawn with unknown bounds where necessary; no retries/fifth call/alternate output. Original cache DATA remains nonexecutable and unchanged; only a verified private loader copy may execute these CPU cases.\n\nValidation:19focusedPASS on host-only CPU fixtures. Full1889cases1882PASS7skip. Sole fresh wholebranch review found2Important relocation/mapping boundary issues,8data-only adversarial forms RED\u2192GREEN and fixed in one pass; no crafted payload executed. DeferredMinor1:nested manifest.json closure/size accounting,unused by the source-owned fixture graph. Exact sourceCI precedes4fixed-imageCPUcases. No SDK build/request activation/download/extraction/new image/SDK target/scientific execution/merge/environment publication. Stage7 remains incomplete and strict0/4FAIL.\n",
